      "id": "4218106298017047872_77767",
      "question": "An explosion on this object resulted in the spilling of 200 million gallons of oil into the Gulf of Mexico.\nFor the point, name this BP semi- submersible offshore drilling rig south of Louisiana, the destruction of which created the greatest marine oil spill in history.",
